= March 2020 — The first lockdown

Schools close, borders tighten and hospitals cancel planned care overnight.
Ambulances queue, care workers improvise protection and families lose income in
days, not months. PiS asks us for national unity while avoiding the
constitutional state of natural disaster that would postpone the presidential
election. We must answer both the danger in the wards and the abuse hidden in
the calendar.

- @covid_social
- @covid_legal
- @covid_unity
- @covid_liberty

@covid_social
title: Support restrictions only with a worker and care guarantee
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources. The broadest Left response.
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources to organise the package.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; covid_policy = "Restrictions with a social shield"; health_policy_pressure += 8; household_policy_pressure += 9; labor_credibility += 8; public_trust += 4; covid_anti_system_pressure -= 4; pandemic_deaths_pressure -= 1; pis_solidarist_share += 2; pis_market_hardliner_share -= 2; ko_social_liberal_share += 2; ko_classical_liberal_share -= 2; pis_relation -= 2; last_policy_stage = "Proposal"; last_policy_authority = "Parliamentary opposition"; last_policy_implementation = 0; news_headline = "The lockdown debate turns toward work and care"

We back necessary health measures and demand paid sick leave, wage replacement,
hospital money and protection from eviction. Employers attack the price; a
worker sent home without wages can explain why we chose it.

- @poland_hub: Govern from opposition

@covid_legal
title: Demand a constitutional state of natural disaster
subtitle: Protects electoral law; sounds remote from household fear.
on-arrival: covid_policy = "Constitutional emergency"; constitutional_restraint += 9; judicial_legitimacy += 4; ko_relation += 3; public_trust += 1; household_policy_pressure -= 3; health_policy_pressure -= 1; covid_anti_system_pressure += 2; pandemic_deaths_pressure += 1; news_headline = "The Left makes the election calendar a constitutional issue"

Our legal case is strong and the government refuses it. People waiting for
income support hear much less about that part.

- @poland_hub: Govern from opposition

@covid_unity
title: Offer the government temporary national unity
subtitle: Immediate trust; PiS writes most of the terms.
on-arrival: covid_policy = "National unity"; pis_relation += 7; president_relation += 4; public_trust += 5; health_policy_pressure += 2; household_policy_pressure -= 1; covid_anti_system_pressure -= 2; pandemic_deaths_pressure += 1; pis_solidarist_share += 2; pis_market_hardliner_share -= 2; party_unity -= 4; razem_dissent += 5; progressives_dissent += 3; last_policy_stage = "Advocacy"; last_policy_authority = "Parliamentary opposition"; last_policy_implementation = 0; news_headline = "The opposition lowers its voice as the virus spreads"

Our gesture reassures frightened voters and lets the cabinet decide when the
emergency—and our silence—will end. Razem begins to count the concessions we
did not demand.

- @poland_hub: Govern from opposition

@covid_liberty
title: Oppose the lockdown as disproportionate
subtitle: A high-risk civil-libertarian and anti-system line.
on-arrival: covid_policy = "Opposition to lockdown"; constitutional_restraint += 2; health_policy_pressure -= 7; household_policy_pressure -= 4; pandemic_deaths_pressure += 6; public_trust -= 8; left_poll -= 0.8; far_right_agenda += 9; covid_anti_system_pressure += 14; konf_org_resources += 2; konf_poll_momentum += 0.45; konf_braunist_share += 4; konf_mentzenite_share += 4; konf_nationalist_share -= 8; razem_dissent += 4; news_headline = "The Left enters an anti-lockdown field already owned by Konfederacja"

We expose restrictions that are badly grounded and poorly drafted, then lose
that distinction beside actors who deny the danger itself. Konfederacja takes
the recruits; we take responsibility for their argument.

- @poland_hub: Govern from opposition

@shield
