    (Number(Q.administrative_reform_pressure) || 0) + 4;
Q.media_capacity = (Number(Q.media_capacity) || 0) + 2;
Q.news_headline =
    "The audit chamber opens the emergency-procurement file";
!}

The referral goes in with dates, transfers and the ministry officials who
signed. The chamber has powers we do not: it can demand the contract, the
bank confirmations and the internal correspondence, and it can publish what it
finds without asking a minister's permission.

This is the difference between an accusation and a finding. The accusation
lasts a news cycle; the finding sits in a public register for the rest of the
parliament and is quoted by every journalist who comes to the subject later.

