The demand is one page: flights, cars, official residences, published quarterly
with the office-holder's name against each. Not an accusation about Kuchciński
— a standing rule, applying to the Marshal, the ministers, the presidential
chancellery and every deputy including ours.

PiS cannot vote it down in the month it lost a Marshal to a flight log, so it
buries it in committee instead, which is a different and more useful kind of
defeat. The register text exists from now on and is taken down and dusted off
every time somebody senior is photographed getting off an aircraft.

