The six come back and the rule is written by the people it binds: which votes
are whipped, who decides, and what a deputy is entitled to say in public about
a decision they were not part of.

Czarzasty's office has lost an argument in front of every current in the
building, three months before a unification congress. What the common party
gains is a caucus that will not have to be suspended again to be held together.

