Q.institutional_trust = (Number(Q.institutional_trust) || 0) + 2;
Q.news_headline =
    "The merger settlement is enforced against the leadership that signed it";
!}

The settlement we agreed says what happens to a deputy who dissents on a vote
their current did not authorise, and it says it in terms that bind the chair as
well. We read it out, apply it, and the suspensions are resolved by a document
rather than by whoever is strongest in the room.

That is the moment the settlement stops being a communiqué. Every current now
knows the text can be invoked against the leadership, which is worth
considerably more to the common party than six reinstatements.

- @poland_hub: Continue
